{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>多份本地報章本月起加價。</p><p></p><p>其中《明報》今日起每份由12元加至15元。《信報》及《經濟日報》就由明天起加價。</p><p></p><p>《經濟日報》由12元加至15元，《信報》就由15元加至18元。對上一次本地中文報章加價是在2024年第4季。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:02.917757+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T02:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:49:06.700795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:46.686280+00:00","content_hash":"feffa817f9d926e85da117f1f4de4131b777c1e4fc7cf61c2c367ac7f1293f20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:02.917757+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}